PlotTracer graph-type suggestion: models
========================================

These two image classifiers suggest a captured figure's graph type in Automatic graph extraction
(beta). They run offline, inside PlotTracer, on ONNX Runtime Web (see ../ocr-model/NOTICE).

docling.onnx is DocumentFigureClassifier v2.5 from the Docling project, unchanged.

